{
    "category": "timers",
    "dependencies": [],
    "description": "Текущее monotonic time в миллисекундах",
    "header": "",
    "id": "core.timers.now_ms",
    "includes": [
        "time.h"
    ],
    "language": "c",
    "name": "now_ms",
    "origin": "core",
    "ports": {
        "input": [
            {
                "kind": "execution",
                "name": "flow_in",
                "type": "exec"
            }
        ],
        "output": [
            {
                "kind": "execution",
                "name": "flow_out",
                "type": "exec"
            },
            {
                "name": "result",
                "type": "int"
            }
        ]
    },
    "source": "",
    "source_code": "int dq_now_ms(void) {\n    struct timespec ts;\n    long long value = 0;\n    if (clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &ts) != 0)\n        return 0;\n    value = (long long) ts.tv_sec * 1000LL + (long long) (ts.tv_nsec / 1000000L);\n    return (int) (value % 2147483647LL);\n}",
    "version": "1.0",
    "metadata": {
        "deltaq.doc.when_to_use": "Когда graph должен зафиксировать monotonic timestamp перед внешним шагом или коротким runtime budget check.",
        "deltaq.doc.limitations": "Linux-first helper: возвращает значение в `int`, поэтому long-running uptime eventually wrap-around; ориентирован на короткие interval/budget проверки, а не на wall-clock time."
    }
}
